                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Our recent workshop in Kano State successfully trained over 500 young individuals in digital literacy.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="read-more-link stretched-link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#newsModal1">Read More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="card h-100 border-0 news-card">
