                        <div class="small text-muted mb-2"><i class="far fa-calendar me-2"></i>Jul 05, 2025</div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">New Tech Hub in Lagos</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Launching a state-of-the-art technology hub to foster innovation and support tech startups.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="read-more-link stretched-link">Read More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 5 -->
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="card h-100 border-0 news-card">
                    <div class="position-relative">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517486808906-6ca8b3f04846?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" class="card-img-top" alt="Partnership Meeting" style="height: 220px; object-fit: cover;">
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3">Partnership</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <div class="small text-muted mb-2"><i class="far fa-calendar me-2"></i>Jun 12, 2025</div>
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Strategic Partnership with UNDP</h5>
                        <p class="card-text text-muted small">Collaborating with UNDP to expand our youth development programs across three new states.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="read-more-link stretched-link">Read More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center mt-5">
            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="News" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg rounded-pill px-5 fw-bold">View All News</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about" class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-4" style="color: #667eea;">OUR KEY AREAS OF INTERVENTIONS</h2>
                
                <div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; color: #667eea;">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5>Socioeconomic Development</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Promoting livelihood opportunities through entrepreneurship development and capacity building in rural communities.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; color: #667eea;">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5>Education & Skills</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Building skilled and innovative workforce through research, training and educational opportunities.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; color: #667eea;">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5>Social Protection</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Promoting policies that support youth, education, agriculture and agro-allied skills development.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; color: #667eea;">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5>Leadership Development</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Building leadership capacity and enabling environment for young people across Nigeria.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- What We Do / Services Section -->
<section id="services" class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-4" style="color: #667eea;">WHAT WE DO</h2>
        
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Exuberant Pathfinders focuses on <strong>SEVEN (7) THEMATIC AREAS</strong> to provide service delivery and improve livelihoods of local communities across Nigeria:
        </p>
        
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div style="height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <img src="/images/theme-education.svg" alt="Education" style="width: 50px; height: 50px;">
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Education</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small">Quality education and skill acquisition programs for youth development.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div style="height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <img src="/images/theme-healthcare.svg" alt="Healthcare" style="width: 50px; height: 50px;">
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Healthcare</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small">Community wellness and health improvement initiatives.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div style="height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <img src="/images/theme-environment.svg" alt="Environment" style="width: 50px; height: 50px;">
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Climate Change</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small">Sustainable and eco-friendly environmental initiatives.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div style="height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-gavel fa-2x" style="color: #667eea;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Conflict & Justice</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small">Peace, security and justice promotion programs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div style="height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-city fa-2x" style="color: #667eea;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Local Governance</h5>
