<!-- News Modals -->
<!-- Modal 1 -->
<div class="modal fade" id="newsModal1" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="newsModal1Label" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="newsModal1Label">Empowering 500 Youth in Kano</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531545514256-b1400bc00f31?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" class="img-fluid rounded mb-4" alt="Youth Workshop">
                <p>Our recent workshop in Kano State was a resounding success, empowering over 500 young individuals with critical digital literacy and entrepreneurship skills. The intensive program covered a range of topics from basic computer skills to advanced digital marketing, financial management, and business plan development.</p>
                <p>Participants engaged in hands-on sessions, collaborative projects, and received mentorship from seasoned entrepreneurs and tech experts. The initiative aimed to bridge the skills gap and foster a culture of innovation and self-reliance among the youth in the region. We are incredibly proud of the dedication and enthusiasm shown by all participants and look forward to seeing the impactful ventures they will create.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Modal 2 -->
<div class="modal fade" id="newsModal2" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="newsModal2Label" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="newsModal2Label">Community Health Outreach</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" class="img-fluid rounded mb-4" alt="Community Outreach">
                <p>In our commitment to holistic community development, we partnered with local health workers to conduct a comprehensive health outreach program. The initiative provided free medical checkups, essential medicines, and health education to over 1,000 residents in underserved rural communities.</p>
                <p>A key focus was on preventative care, with sessions on hygiene, nutrition, and maternal health. This outreach is part of our broader strategy to ensure that healthy communities can thrive and pursue economic opportunities without the burden of preventable illnesses.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Modal 3 -->
<div class="modal fade" id="newsModal3" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="newsModal3Label" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="newsModal3Label">2025 Grant Winners Announced</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" class="img-fluid rounded mb-4" alt="Grant Award">
                <p>We are thrilled to announce the 50 recipients of our 2025 annual business grant. After a rigorous selection process from over 2,000 applications, these exceptional young entrepreneurs have been chosen for their innovative ideas and potential for community impact.</p>
                <p>The grants will provide crucial seed funding to help these ventures grow, create jobs, and solve local challenges. We congratulate all the winners and look forward to supporting them on their journey to success. Their stories are a testament to the incredible talent and drive of Nigeria's youth.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

